  "title": "Universe | Video Editing &amp; VFX Plugin Library",
  "paragraphs": [
    "Maxon Universe empowers you to create engaging content with a vast library of motion graphics, video transitions and effects plugins. Bring your video post-production and motion graphics design to the next level.",
    "What's New →",
    "To use the application you will have to register for a MyMaxon account and accept our EULA.",
    "Universe is a powerful video editing and visual effects plugin library, part of Red Giant's toolkit. With its transitions, visual effects, and motion graphics capabilities, you can easily create stunning videos and footage. Immerse your clips in retro or modern art styles, design dynamic backgrounds, and add smooth transitions and eye-catching text effects to your videos and films.",
    "We’re pleased to introduce a unified, solution-oriented experience that brings together Red Giant and Universe: All your Universe tools will now be available from the new Maxon Studio Plugin tab inside of Maxon Studio. The Maxon Studio Plugin tab enables faster creative flow, clearer product discovery, and seamless integration between tools by serving as a shared entry point for all Red Giant or Universe plugins, presets, Capsules, and learning content.",
    "Discover how motion graphics artists, video editors and filmmakers use Universe for their video editing projects.",
    "Effortlessly elevate your video projects with a 'Universe' of creative possibilities. Explore how Maxon Universe supports your creative projects.",
    "Explore Universe's features to transform your creative projects.",
    "Contact us for any inquiry for you or your team.",
    "Get answers to commonly asked questions about Universe.",
    "Universe is the leading suite of video transition and effects plugins for motion graphics, film editing, and video production. With Universe, you can create dynamic titles and animations, or add visual elements like explosions, smoke, and rain. Plus, you can use transitions between video clips and more.",
    "Universe is a popular choice among VFX artists, motion designers, film editors and video content creators. You can easily experiment with a wide range of effects to unlock your design potential. To see if Universe fits your needs, try it for free now !",
    "Yes, Universe is a collection of plugins compatible with various video editing software. This includes Adobe Premiere Pro, After Effects, Final Cut Pro, Autograph, and more. For details, visit our requirements page .",
    "Yes, Maxon Universe provides a wide range of pre-built presets for transitions, effects, and looks. You can also customize these presets or fine-tune individual effects to achieve the perfect style for your project.",
    "Maxon Universe offers essential plugins for motion graphics, transitions, and effects to streamline your video editing projects. It is part of Red Giant's toolkit. Red Giant provides advanced editing tools. It includes rich and advanced color grading, smooth transitions, realistic VFX, and motion design templates to create videos and visuals. Explore Red Giant's complete toolset to achieve full cinematic quality.",
    "Download the Maxon App to start your 14-day free trial of Maxon One. With the Maxon App you can install, use, or try all of our products.",
    "STAY CONNECTED #text-headline{ text-align: center; font-family: 'Rajdhani'; font-weight: 600; font-size: 50px; line-height: 3.5rem; } @media screen and (max-width: 800px) { #text-headline{ display: flex; justify-content: center; font-size: 50px; line-height: 3.5rem; } } @media screen and (max-width: 640px) { #text-headline{ display: flex; justify-content: center; font-size: 36px; line-height: 2.5rem; } }",
    "Their success tells the story of our products value."
  ],
