    "1972659",
    "What is Universe?",
    "xlarge",
    "",
    "1972660",
    "<p>Universe is a powerful video editing and visual effects plugin library, part of Red Giant's toolkit.</p><p>With its transitions, visual effects, and motion graphics capabilities, you can easily create stunning videos and footage. Immerse your clips in retro or modern art styles, design dynamic backgrounds, and add smooth transitions and eye-catching text effects to your videos and films.</p>",
    "2006225",
    "black",
    "2006226",
    "2006227",
    "whats-new",
    "What's New",
    "2125039",
    "<p>We’re pleased to introduce a unified, solution-oriented experience that brings together Red Giant and Universe: All your Universe tools will now be available from the new Maxon Studio Plugin tab inside of Maxon Studio. The Maxon Studio Plugin tab enables faster creative flow, clearer product discovery, and seamless integration between tools by serving as a shared entry point for all Red Giant or Universe plugins, presets, Capsules, and learning content.</p>",
