    "FAQs",
    "1972728",
    "<p>Get answers to commonly asked questions about Universe.</p>",
    "contentBuilder_accordion_BlockType",
    "1972729",
    "What can I do with Universe, especially for video editing?",
    "contentBuilder_pane_BlockType",
    "1972731",
    "<p>Universe is the leading suite of video transition and effects plugins for motion graphics, film editing, and video production.</p><p>With Universe, you can create dynamic titles and animations, or add visual elements like explosions, smoke, and rain. Plus, you can use transitions between video clips and more.</p>",
    "1972732",
    "Is Universe a suitable choice for me?",
    "1972734",
    "<p>\n    Universe is a popular choice among VFX artists, motion designers, film editors and video content creators. You can easily experiment with a wide range of effects to unlock your design potential.\n</p>\n<p>\n    To see if Universe fits your needs, <a href=\"https://www.maxon.net/en/try\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">try it for free now</a>!\n</p>",
    "1972735",
    "Does Universe support other tools or software?",
    "1972737",
    "<p>Yes, Universe is a collection of plugins compatible with various video editing software. This includes Adobe Premiere Pro, After Effects, Final Cut Pro, Autograph, and more. For details, visit our <a href=\"https://www.maxon.net/en/requirements\">requirements page</a>.</p>",
    "1972738",
    "Can I customize the effects in Maxon Universe? Does it offer presets?",
    "1972740",
    "<p>Yes, Maxon Universe provides a wide range of pre-built presets for transitions, effects, and looks. You can also customize these presets or fine-tune individual effects to achieve the perfect style for your project.</p>",
    "1972741",
    "What’s the difference between Red Giant and Universe?",
    "1972743",
    "<p>\n    Maxon Universe offers essential plugins for motion graphics, transitions, and effects to streamline your video editing projects. It is part of Red Giant's toolkit.\n</p>\n<p>\n    Red Giant provides advanced editing tools. It includes rich and advanced color grading, smooth transitions, realistic VFX, and motion design templates to create videos and visuals. Explore <a href=\"https://www.maxon.net/en/red-giant-0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Red Giant's complete toolset</a> to achieve full cinematic quality.\n</p>",
    "1972744",
    "https://mxwebnuxtprod01.blob.core.windows.net/media/images/Products/Universe/Universe_Seamless_Integration.jpg",
    "Universe_Seamless_Integration.jpg",
    "1972745",
    "1972746",
    "Try Universe",
    "1972747",
    "<p>Download the Maxon App to start your 14-day free trial of Maxon One.<br />With the Maxon App you can install, use, or try all of our products.</p>",
    "1972748",
    "<a href=\"https://www.maxon.net/en/try\">Get the Trial for free</a>",
